«ENDDEFINE»


«DEFINE SizeAnnotation(Stereotype directValidationStereotype, List[Dependency] validationDependencies, List[JMM::ValidationGroup] defaultValidationGroups, boolean hasValidationGroups) FOR NamedElement»
	«REM»No validation groups needed (= only direct validation and no indirect validation stereotypes)«ENDREM»
	«IF directValidationStereotype != null && hasValidationGroups == false»
		«LET (Size)this AS sizeAnnotation»
			@«getEnterpriseJavaPackage()».validation.constraints.Size(min = «IF sizeAnnotation.min != -1»«sizeAnnotation.min»«ELSE»0«ENDIF», max = «IF sizeAnnotation.max != -1»«sizeAnnotation.max»«ELSE»Integer.MAX_VALUE«ENDIF»«EXPAND ValidationAnnotationBasics FOR sizeAnnotation»)
		«ENDLET»
	«REM»Resolve validation groups for which the validation should be applied«ENDREM»
	«ELSE»
		«IF directValidationStereotype != null && defaultValidationGroups.isEmpty == false»
			«LET (Size)this AS sizeAnnotation»
